Id: perm020w
Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: check_perms
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The indicated disk device file is world readable, writable or both.  This
allows the file access controls to be bypassed.  The world permissions
should be removed.
